{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は本当のクリスマスでしたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かスペシャルなことしましたか～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はケーキ食べたくらい(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でももうみなさんと充分に楽しんだからいいんだ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はMステスーパーライブに出演させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に豪華なステージでしたね～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年まではずっとテレビで見ていたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何だか出ているのが不思議でしたっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間だったけどワクワク楽しめたよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タモリさんと少し会話ができて、おばあちゃんも喜んでました(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年も呼んでいただけるように頑張るぞー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2014/12/27/7242115/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ先輩と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2014/12/27/7242115/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女神ちーちゃんと M作った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装がいつもと違うの気づいたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真だとわかりづらいけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリジナル衣装で歌番組出るのも初めてだったので嬉しかった～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にとっては年末最後の歌番組でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「何度目の青空か？」色んなところで歌わせていただいたなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真ん中に立たせていただいて、ぜいたくな経験をしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一生の大事な思い出映像です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年もまた新しい曲を出していきますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂に出てほしい！出てきて嬉しい！と思っていただけるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"より頑張ります☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ところで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"季刊乃木坂 彩冬が発売中です♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表紙をさせていただきました<(_ _*)>"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2014/12/27/7242115/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時期はまだ雪降ってなくて、人工的に作ったんだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下に積もってるのは綿とか塩。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上からのはハシゴの上のマシンから吹き出してくる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいよね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2014/12/27/7242115/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これも発泡スチロールで作った雪だるま！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2014/12/27/7242115/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2014/12/27/7242115/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2014/12/27/7242115/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春夏秋ときてやっと回ってきた冬号なので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ見てもらえたらなと思います♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっつん、ろってぃ、ゆーり、あみ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後p、琴子、みり愛、生駒ちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"も載ってます！ みんなかわいいよー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残すイベントは明日の握手会と30日の感謝祭！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと4日で2014年終わっちゃうーーーー>_<"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}